{"exercise_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S282-EXERCISE-282XT","hint_ordinal":1,"id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S282-HINT-282XT-01","provenance":{"basis":"active Hint macro associated with source segment 282Xt","kind":"source-derived-hint-map"},"record_type":"hint","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","segment_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S282-SEG-282XT","semantic_anchor":"282Xt","source_anchor":"282Xt","source_line_start":1545,"source_raw_tex_sha256":"610c9533c0fc1fb394c766154809175eb0f06e934092b02151c8a7effa27e2dc","source_text":"use\n282K to show that there is an $f$, and 282Xn to show that its Fourier\nsums converge wherever its Fej\\'er sums do;  use 282Q and 282Xs to\nshow that $f*f*f$ is differentiable.","target_line_start":1527,"target_raw_tex_sha256":"b241017717ab681070e6e25a71a03e1256c4f5c585e9f4bf660a6668550e7c2a","target_text":"menggunakan\n282K untuk menunjukkan bahwa terdapat $f$, dan 282Xn untuk menunjukkan bahwa jumlah Fourier\nnya konvergen di setiap titik tempat jumlah Fej\\'er-nya konvergen; gunakan 282Q dan 282Xs untuk\nmenunjukkan bahwa $f*f*f$ terdiferensiasi.","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S282"}
