{"exercise_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S282-EXERCISE-282YE","hint_ordinal":2,"id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S282-HINT-282YE-02","provenance":{"basis":"active Hint macro associated with source segment 282Ye","kind":"source-derived-hint-map"},"record_type":"hint","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","segment_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S282-SEG-282YE","semantic_anchor":"282Ye","source_anchor":"282Ye","source_line_start":1604,"source_raw_tex_sha256":"e8314f47394f6d99a5366deb1d0b31bdfdd23a27f069019f5fdb044bcda5cb12","source_text":"take $n$ such that\n$\\Bover1{2\\pi}\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}\n|\\bover{\\sin(n+{1\\over2})t}{\\sin{1\\over 2}t}|dt>\\Bover1{\\delta}$ and set\n$f(x)=\\Bover{\\delta}{\\eta}$ for $0\\le x\\le\\eta$, $0$ otherwise, where\n$\\eta$ is small.","target_line_start":1585,"target_raw_tex_sha256":"57924cdae98cce147f983ea757b72f2ee354c7c566fff7a96c067f5b8834c237","target_text":"ambil $n$ sedemikian rupa sehingga\n$\\Bover1{2\\pi}\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}\n|\\bover{\\sin(n+{1\\over2})t}{\\sin{1\\over 2}t}|dt>\\Bover1{\\delta}$ dan tetapkan\n$f(x)=\\Bover{\\delta}{\\eta}$ untuk $0\\le x\\le\\eta$, $0$ sebaliknya, jika\n$\\eta$ kecil.","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S282"}
